        "created_at": "2015-05-21T07:41:48.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I have got an offer to buy a used pc. Is this pc will be good for online gaming?<br>OS: Windows 8.1 64 bit<br>CPU: AMD FX-8350 Black Edition<br>GPU: MSI GeForce GTX 760 Gaming 4GB<br>Motherboard: ASUS M5A99X EVO R2.0, Socket-AM3+<br>Memory: Corsair Vengeance DDR3 1600MHz 8GB CL9<br>Storage: Corsair Force Series GS 128GB and WD Caviar Blue 1TB 7200RPM<br>Optical drive: ASUS DVD Writer, DRW-24F1ST<br>Power supply: Corsair CX 600M, 600W PSU<br>Case: NZXT Phantom 410</p>",
