      {
        "id": 141822,
        "name": "Foote",
        "username": "Foote",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/foote/{size}/1877_2.png",
        "created_at": "2015-05-21T13:31:41.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>1) Internet speed? No spec PC will do well without a solid connection. I understand that usually goes without saying, but I'm throwing it out there anyway.</p><p>2) Windows 8...ehhh. If it were my harddrive I would reformat that to windows 7. But thats just me. Personal preference.</p><p>3) 600W power supply? Of all the parts of a PC to pinch pennies on this isn't one of them. 600W is too low to be reliable. You'll burn that sucker out. 900W at least.</p><p>4) If you have the cash to spare, bumping the 8GB of RAM to 16GB would be prefered, but it's pretty low on the priority totem pole</p>",
        "post_number": 2,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T04:18:59.528Z",
        "reply_count": 0,
        "reply_to_post_number": null,
        "quote_count": 0,
        "incoming_link_count": 0,
