        "raw": "<p>1) Internet speed? No spec PC will do well without a solid connection. I understand that usually goes without saying, but I&#39;m throwing it out there anyway.</p><p>2) Windows 8...ehhh. If it were my harddrive I would reformat that to windows 7. But thats just me. Personal preference.</p><p>3) 600W power supply? Of all the parts of a PC to pinch pennies on this isn&#39;t one of them. 600W is too low to be reliable. You&#39;ll burn that sucker out. 900W at least.</p><p>4) If you have the cash to spare, bumping the 8GB of RAM to 16GB would be prefered, but it&#39;s pretty low on the priority totem pole</p>",
