        "created_at": "2015-05-21T13:43:50.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I agree with Foote, although if you don't have a spare license for Win7 around, look into something like Classic Shell.&nbsp; It'll make Windows 8 work a bit more like Windows 7.&nbsp; Really, the Start Menu is the BIGGEST annoyance, and that's what Classic Shell fixes.</p>",
